n\r\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">17h00: It is time to get transferred back to Hanoi</span>\r\n\r\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">19h30 – 19h45: Drop you off at your hotel in Hanoi Old Quarter.</span>'),
