(6117, 1280, 'schedule_0_content', '<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><strong>10:00</strong>: Welcome to Ha Long International Cruise Port and proceed with express check-in for a smooth and an easy boarding process.</span>\r\n\r\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><strong>10:30</strong>: Enjoy a refreshing welcome drink as you immerse yourself in the breathtaking world of natural </span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">wonders. Admire the majestic limestone mountains rising from the emerald waters of Halong Bay.</span>\r\n\r\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><strong>11:15</strong>: Enjoy a delightful lunch at the 5-star restaurant on Leona Cruise as you glide past thousands of </span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">majestic limestone karsts in the heart of the World Heritage Site.</span>\r\n\r\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><strong>12:15</strong>: Our first excursion takes you to Sung Sot Cave, the largest and most spectacular cave in Ha Long </span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Bay, featuring a stunning system of stalactites and stalagmites formed over millions of years.</span>\r\n\r\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><strong>13h30</strong>: Explore the tranquil Luon Cave with a unique arch, shaped structure, featuring ancient rock </span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">formations and home to golden monkeys. Kayak/bamboo boat rides are must try activities at this ideal </span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">destination</span>\r\n\r\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><strong>14:15</strong>: Arrive at the beautiful Titov Island, known for its crescent shaped beach and turquoise water. </span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Swim, relax, or hike to the top for a panoramic view of Halong Bay</span>\r\n\r\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><strong>15:30</strong>: Unwind with our sunset party, complete with music and light refreshments. Cruise through the </span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">most picturesque areas of the bay as the sun begins to set.</span>\r\n\r\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><strong>17:00-17:30</strong>: Disembark at the harbor, farewell to guests, thank you to enjoy our trip and see you in the </span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">next journey!</span>'),
