(6487, 1379, 'schedule_0_title', 'Tour schedule'),
(6488, 1379, '_schedule_0_title', 'field_6499083f75a8d'),
(6489, 1379, 'schedule_0_content', '<b>10:00 – 10:15: WELCOME GUESTS AT HALONG CRUISE PORT </b>\r\n\r\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Halong Symphony\'s management team is pleased to welcome you at Ha Long International Cruise Port, with a warm and friendly welcome to begin your journey to visit and explore Ha Long Bay. </span>\r\n\r\n<b>10:30 : DEPARTURE TO THE HALONG BAY </b>\r\n\r\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Our cruise leaves the port, taking you to begin the cruise to experience the wonderful beauty that nature bestows on Ha Long Bay. At the time, you listen to our introduction to Halong Symphony cruise, safety regulations and itinerary cruise. </span>\r\n\r\n<b>11:45 - 12:45: VISIT SURPRISE CAVE </b>\r\n\r\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The guide will take you to explore one of the largest and most beautiful caves in Ha Long Bay that is named “Surprise Cave”. Our guide presents the interesting information about the cave as an indispensable part of the Heritage cruise. </span>\r\n\r\n<b>12:45 - 13:45: LUNCH TIME </b>\r\n\r\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">On returning to the cruise, you will be served a Buffet lunch with hearty Asian and European dishes at the restaurant on the cruise (</span><i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Set Menu will be served if we have less than 30 guests</span></i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">). </span>\r\n\r\n<b>13:45 - 14:30: LUON CAVE (Additional fee 120,000 VND/person) </b>\r\n\r\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">After lunch, our journey continues with a very interesting experience: a sampan rowed by local people or kayaking to explore Luon Cave - a place that opens up to a peaceful valley on the bay. (</span><i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Please inform our guide on board if you would like to do this experience</span></i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">) </span>\r\n\r\n<b>14:45 - 15:45: VISIT TITOV ISLAND </b>\r\n\r\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">We arrive at Titov island, where you can immerse yourself in the emerald water of Halong Bay or climb to the top of Titov mountain to capture the magnificent panorama of Ha Long. </span>\r\n\r\n<b>15:45 - 17:00: SUNSET PARTY </b>\r\n\r\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">It is the time for you to enjoy the Halong Bay sunset with a tea party under the beautiful view of Ha Long Bay, or you can choose to experience Halong Symphony\'s unique Jacuzzi areas. </span>\r\n\r\n<b>17:30: END OF JOURNEY </b>'),
