(6620, 1383, 'schedule_0_title', 'Day 1: Ha Long Bay'),
(6621, 1383, '_schedule_0_title', 'field_6499083f75a8d'),
(6622, 1383, 'schedule_0_content', '<strong>11:15 - 11:30: Check-In</strong>\r\nComplete check-in procedures at the Grand Pioneers Cruise waiting lounge at Tuan Chau International Cruise Port.\r\n\r\n<strong>12:00 - 12:15: Transfer to the Cruise</strong>\r\nGuests will be transferred from the lounge to the cruise by high-speed tenders.\r\n\r\n<strong>12:15 - 12:45: Welcome &amp; Safety Briefing</strong>\r\nEnjoy a welcome drink at the 5th-floor restaurant while the cruise manager introduces the itinerary, onboard services, and important safety and security regulations for your voyage.\r\n\r\n<strong>12:45 - 14:30: Buffet Lunch</strong>\r\nEnjoy a buffet lunch featuring delicious Vietnamese dishes while admiring the stunning views of Ha Long Bay. During the journey, the cruise passes by majestic limestone islands shaped by nature over millions of years.\r\n\r\n<strong>15:30 - 17:00: Explore Sung Sot Cave</strong>\r\nGuests will be transferred by tender with assistance from the Grand Pioneers staff to visit Sung Sot Cave, one of the most beautiful caves in Ha Long Bay, discovered by French explorers in 1901. After the excursion, guests return to the cruise.\r\n\r\n<strong>17:30 - 18:30: Cooking Class &amp; Canapé Party</strong>\r\nReturn to the cruise and enjoy the sunset over the bay while attending a cooking class, savoring a canapé party, and trying special cocktails during Happy Hour.\r\n\r\n<strong>19:00 - 21:00: Dinner at the Restaurant</strong>\r\nSavor a carefully crafted dinner menu that combines unique flavors with culinary sophistication in every dish.\r\n\r\n<strong>21:00 - 23:00: Evening Activities</strong>\r\nRelax at your leisure or participate in squid fishing. Guests may also enjoy onboard services such as the spa, karaoke, or games in the entertainment room.'),
(6623, 1383, '_schedule_0_content', 'field_6499084975a8e'),
(6624, 1383, 'schedule_1_title', 'Day 2: Ha Long Bay - Tuan Chau'),
(6625, 1383, '_schedule_1_title', 'field_6499083f75a8d'),
(6626, 1383, 'schedule_1_content', '<strong>06:30 - 07:30: Amazing Sunrise Time &amp; Light Breakfast</strong>\r\nWelcome the sunrise over the bay and enjoy a light breakfast at the restaurant.\r\n\r\n<strong>07:30 - 08:45: Visit Luon Cave</strong>\r\nVisit Luon Cave, famous for its beautiful natural arch. Guests can explore the area by bamboo boat or kayak.\r\n\r\n<strong>09:00 - 09:30: Check Out</strong>\r\nReturn to the cruise, relax, complete the check-out procedures, and settle any onboard expenses at the Reception desk.\r\n\r\n<strong>09:00 - 10:15: Brunch Buffet</strong>\r\nEnjoy a delicious brunch buffet served at the restaurant.\r\n\r\n<strong>10:30 - 10:45: Return to Grand Pioneers Waiting Lounge</strong>\r\nDisembark and return to the Grand Pioneers Lounge at Tuan Chau Harbor. End of your journey.'),
