(7250, 1562, '_schedule_0_title', 'field_6499083f75a8d'),
(7251, 1562, 'schedule_0_content', '<b>09:30-10:00</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Our guide and driver will pick you up fromyour hotel, depart for Ba Na Hill through one of the most beautiful seaside streets of Central Vietnam.</span>\r\n\r\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">10:30-11:00 Arrive in Ba Na, you have lunch; you will have a chance to experience the cablesystem up to the top of the hill and enjoy the beautiful sight of Mo stream, Toc Tien waterfall. Sightseeing on Ba Na Hill to: </span>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Hand of the gods hold Vietnam’s Golden Bridge.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">L’Jardin Zone with French Architecture Building: Tinh Tâm Garden, French Stable, one hundred year-old pomelo tree, Old Villas.</span></li>\r\n 	<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Freedom to explore  Linh Ung Pagoda, 27 meters Buddha Statue, Loc Uyen Garden.</span></li>\r\n 	<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">From Debay station, you will get on the second cable system to move to Nui Chua Peak – the rooftop of Da nang City. </span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Continue the tour with Fantasy Park – one of the most modern indoor game centers of the Asia.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<b>16:30 - 17:00</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Go down by the cable system. Get on coach and return the city center.</span>\r\n\r\n<b>18:00 - 18:30</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Drop off at your hotel.  End of services. Goodbye &amp; See you again!</span>\r\n\r\n<b>* INCLUDED: </b>\r\n<ol>\r\n 	<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Transfered by good- condition vehicle. </span></li>\r\n 	<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Good English Speaking Guide.</span></li>\r\n 	<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Buffet  lunch in Ba Na.</span></li>\r\n 	<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Entrance fees for sightseeing. (Round trip cable car, Admission to Golden Bridge, Admission to Le Jardin Damour Gardens, Admission to French Village, Admission to Fantasy Park ( not free for game with coins and awards), Admission to Rose Garden and other services as regulated; excluding the Debay Wine Cellar, Wax Museum, 10D cinema, alpine coaster, mountain climbing games, wow pass , fee to join games with coins and awards. </span></li>\r\n 	<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Mineral water </span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<b>* NOTE:</b>\r\n<ol>\r\n 	<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Please provide personal information including Full name, Birth-year, Gender, Nationality and Contact details.</span></li>\r\n 	<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Under 1m: Free of charge (Shared lunch with parents). 1m-1m4: 80% of full charge.  Above 1m4: Full charge.</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n&nbsp;'),
