(1270, 6, '2026-05-29 14:14:43', '2026-05-29 07:14:43', '<b>INCLUSION :</b><b> </b>\r\n<ol>\r\n 	<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Full transfers Hanoi - Ninh Binh - Hanoi by Thaco Limousine(17-22 Pax)/ Luxury D-Car (9-11 Pax) round trip</span></li>\r\n 	<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">English Speaking Guide</span></li>\r\n 	<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">All Entrance fees </span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">&amp; sharing boat at Tam Coc or Trang An, Cuc Phuong International Park. The</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> sharing boat at Tam Coc: 2-3pax/boat; Trang An: 4pax/boat</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> </span></li>\r\n 	<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">01 bottle of mineral water/1 way on the Thaco Limousine/ Luxury D-Car</span></li>\r\n 	<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">1 buffet lunch </span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> for Thaco Limousine option, Deluxe Set Menu Lunch for </span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Luxury</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> D-Car option, </span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">1 dinner + 1 lunch set menu; 1 breakfast</span></li>\r\n 	<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Entrance fee &amp; sharing boat at Tam Coc: 2-3pax/boat; Trang An: 4pax/boat</span></li>\r\n 	<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Free usage of rain-coat and conical hat during the trip</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<b>EXCLUSION :</b><b> </b>\r\n<ol>\r\n 	<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">VAT</span></li>\r\n 	<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Drinks</span></li>\r\n 	<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Tips for tour guide &amp; driver and personal expenses</span></li>\r\n 	<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Holiday surcharges</span></li>\r\n 	<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">All services and items not mentioned specifically in the list above</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<b>THINGS YOU SHOULD BRING</b>\r\n<ol>\r\n 	<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"4\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Hat, umbrella, shoes</span></li>\r\n 	<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"4\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Sun cream, sun glasses</span></li>\r\n 	<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"4\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Mosquito spray</span></li>\r\n 	<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"4\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Camera</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<b>CHILDREN POLICY :</b>\r\n<ol>\r\n 	<li aria-level=\"1\">Child 1-4 years old: Free charge, sharing the service with parents Surcharge will be applied If you request a private seat for child from 1-4 years old. <span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Child from 5 to 8 charge 75% adult and use services as an adult ( Applied for 1 child, the second child will be charged 100% of adult price)</span></li>\r\n 	<li aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Child from 09 and above charge as adult</span></li>\r\n</ol>', 'NINH BINH 2 DAYS 1 NIGHT  : HOA LU - TRANG AN/ TAM COC BOAT TRIP - MUA CAVE - CUC PHUONG NATIONAL PARK', '<ul>\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1nddij\" data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"267\">Visit the ancient capital of <span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\"><span class=\"whitespace-normal\">Hoa Lư</span></span>, enjoy a boat trip in <span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\"><span class=\"whitespace-normal\">Tràng An Scenic Landscape Complex</span></span> 