(1304, 6, '2026-06-01 11:06:13', '2026-06-01 04:06:13', '/*css 1/6/2026*/\n.main-title * {\n    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 5vw, 3rem); /* 28px -> 48px */\n    font-weight: bold;\n}\n\n.gtranslate-custom {\n    text-align: right;\n}\n\n\n/* Giao diện GTranslate */\n.gtranslate-custom select {\n    background-color: #ffffff;\n    color: #222;\n    border: 1px solid #ddd;\n    border-radius: 8px;\n    padding: 6px 10px;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);\n    cursor: pointer;\n    transition: all 0.3s ease;\n}\n\n/* Hover select */\n.gtranslate-custom select:hover {\n    border-color: #0073e6;\n    background-color: #f0f8ff;\n}\n\n/* Link ngôn ngữ */\n.gtranslate-custom a {\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    text-decoration: none;\n    padding: 6px 10px;\n    margin: 5px 3px;\n    background: #f9f9f9;\n    color: #333;\n    border: 1px solid #ddd;\n    border-radius: 6px;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    transition: all 0.3s;\n}\n\n/* Icon cờ quốc gia trong link */\n.gtranslate-custom a img {\n    width: 20px;\n    height: 14px;\n    margin-right: 5px;\n    object-fit: cover;\n}\n\n/* Hover link */\n.gtranslate-custom a:hover {\n    background: #0073e6;\n    color: #fff;\n    border-color: #0073e6;\n}\n\n/* Responsive Mobile */\n@media (max-width: 768px) {\n    .gtranslate-custom {\n        display: flex;\n        justify-content: center; /* Căn giữa */\n        align-items: center;\n        flex-wrap: nowrap; /* Không cho xuống hàng */\n        gap: 5px;\n    }\n    .gtranslate-custom a {\n        flex: 0 0 auto;\n        padding: 4px 8px;\n        font-size: 13px;\n    }\n    .gtranslate-custom a img {\n        width: 16px; /* Icon nhỏ hơn */\n        height: 12px;\n        margin-right: 3px;\n    }\n}\n\n\n\n\n\n\n.has-hover .bg,\n.has-hover [class*=image-] img {\n    transition: filter 0.6s ease, opacity 0.6s ease, transform 0.6s ease, box-shadow 0.4s ease;\n    transform-origin: center center;\n}\n\n/* Khi hover */\n.has-hover:hover .bg,\n.has-hover:hover [class*=image-] img {\n    transform: scale(1.03) rotateZ(0.3deg) translateY(-2px); /* chuyển động nhẹ lên */\n    filter: brightness(1.2) contrast(1.1) saturate(1.2); /* giảm độ sáng và bão hòa */\n    box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4), \n                0 0 40px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3), \n                0 0 60px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2), \n                0 5px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1); /* bóng đổ mềm */\n    opacity: 1;\n}\n\n\n\n.box-text a:not(.button),\n.box-text h4,\n.box-text h5,\n.box-text h6 {\n    line-height: 1.3;\n    color: rgb(211 27 27);\n    margin-bottom: .1em;\n    margin-top: .1em;\n    transition: color 0.3s ease, transform 0.3s ease;\n}\n\n.box-text a:not(.button):hover,\n.box-text h4:hover,\n.box-text h5:hover,\n.box-text h6:hover {\n    color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\n    transform: translateY(-3px);\n    cursor: pointer;\n}\n\n\n\n.home_blog .box-blog-post:hover {\n    box-shadow: 0 0px 22px #84c8ff;\n    transform: scale(1.02);\n    padding: 10px 20px;\n    text-align: left;\n}\n.home_blog .box-blog-post {\n    box-shadow: 0 0 18px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);\n    border-radius: 10px; /* Bo góc */\n    transition: all 0.s ease;\n}\n.home_blog .box-blog-post:hover {\n    box-shadow: 0 0px 5px #84c8ff;\n    transform: scale(1.02);\n    padding: 10px 20px;\n    text-align: left;\n    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05); /* Giữ viền khi hover */\n}\n\n\n.tour-outbound {\n    padding: 4.18rem var(--section) 8.81rem;\n    background: var(--Linear, linear-gradient(90deg, var(--Color, #023F88) 0%, var(--Color-2, #0071BB) 100%));\n    display: flex\n;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n}\n\n.tour-outbound .tour-outbound__title h2 {\n    color: #fff;\n    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);\n    font-style: normal;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    line-height: 1.2;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n}\n\n.home-introduce .home-introduce__title h1 {\n    margin-bottom: 1.06rem;\n}\n\n.phongvt-title-main h2,\n.phongvt-title-main h1,\n.phongvt-title-main h3,\n.phongvt-title-main-p p {\n    object-position: 50% 50%;\n    color: var(--Color, #023F88);\n    font-size: 3.5rem;\n    font-style: normal;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    line-height: normal;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n}\n\n/* Tablet */\n@media (max-width: 991px) {\n    .phongvt-title-main h2,\n    .phongvt-title-main h1,\n    .phongvt-title-main h3,\n    .phongvt-title-main-p p {\n        font-size: 2.5rem;\n    }\n}\n\n/* Mobile */\n@media (max-width: 767px) {\n    .phongvt-title-main h2,\n    .phongvt-title-main h1,\n    .phongvt-title-main h3,\n    .phongvt-title-main-p p {\n        font-size: 1.8rem;\n        line-height: 1.3;\n    }\n}\n\n\n\n.tour-outbound {\n    padding: 4.18rem var(--section) 8.81rem;\n    background: var(--Linear, linear-gradient(90deg, var(--Color, #023F88) 0%, var(--Color-2, #0071BB) 100%));\n    display: flex\n;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n}\n\n.fix-section {\n    border-radius: 2.75rem 2.75rem 0rem 0rem;\n    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #01549D 0%, var(--Color-2, #0071BB) 60.5%);\n    padding: 4.44rem var(--section) 16.45rem;\n    overflow: hidden;\n}\n\n\n.appointment .item label {\n    font-size: 14px;\n    font-weight: 500;\n    position: absolute;\n    z-index: 1;\n    background: #fff;\n    left: 10px;\n\n    padding: 0 10px;\n    display: inline-block;\n    width: auto;\n    border-radius: 8px;\n    color: #333;\n}\n.appointment {\n    background: #fff;\n    position: relative;\n    z-index: 1;\n}\n\n\n#header .header-nav-main>.menu-item>a {\n    color: #404040;\n    font-size: 1.1rem;\n    font-style: normal;\n	transition: color 0.3s ease;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    line-height: 1.35rem;\n    padding: var(--30) 0;\n}\n#header .header-nav-main > .menu-item.current-menu-item > a {\n    color: #023f88; /* Màu xanh dương */\n}\n#header .header-nav-main > .menu-item > a:hover {\n    color: #023f88; /* Màu xanh dương */\n}\n\n\n.phongvt-hieu-ung-toa-hinh {\n    display: block;\n    position: relative;\n    overflow: hidden\n}\n\n.phongvt-hieu-ung-toa-hinh:before {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 50%;\n    left: 50%;\n    z-index: 2;\n    display: block;\n    content: \'\';\n    width: 0;\n    height: 0;\n    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.2);\n    border-radius: 100%;\n    opacity: 0;\n    -webkit-transform: translate(-50%, -50%);\n    -ms-transform: translate(-50%, -50%);\n    -o-transform: translate(-50%, -50%);\n    transform: translate(-50%, -50%)\n}\n\n@media (min-width: 1025px) {\n    .phongvt-hieu-ung-toa-hinh:hover:before {\n        -webkit-animation:circle 0.75s;\n        -ms-animation: circle 0.75s;\n        -o-animation: circle 0.75s;\n        animation: circle 0.75s\n    }\n}\n\n@-ms-keyframes circle {\n    0% {\n        opacity: 1\n    }\n\n    40% {\n        opacity: 1\n    }\n\n    100% {\n        width: 200%;\n        height: 200%;\n        opacity: 0\n    }\n}\n\n@-o-keyframes circle {\n    0% {\n        opacity: 1\n    }\n\n    40% {\n        opacity: 1\n    }\n\n    100% {\n        width: 200%;\n        height: 200%;\n        opacity: 0\n    }\n}\n\n@-webkit-keyframes circle {\n    0% {\n        opacity: 1\n    }\n\n    40% {\n        opacity: 1\n    }\n\n    100% {\n        width: 200%;\n        height: 200%;\n        opacity: 0\n    }\n}\n\n@keyframes circle {\n    0% {\n        opacity: 1\n    }\n\n    40% {\n        opacity: 1\n    }\n\n    100% {\n        width: 200%;\n        height: 200%;\n        opacity: 0\n    }\n}', 'flatsome-child', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '852-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-06-01 11:06:13', '2026-06-01 04:06:13', '', 852, 'http://localhost/vionis/?p=1304', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(1305, 6, '2026-06-01 11:08:12', '2026-06-01 04:08:12', '[row style=\"large\" v_align=\"middle\"]\n\n[col span=\"6\" span__sm=\"12\" class=\"ab-img\"]\n\n[ux_image id=\"559\" width=\"69\" height=\"120%\" class=\"img1\"]\n\n[ux_image id=\"73\" height=\"150%\" margin=\"0px 0px 0px 0px\" class=\"img2\"]\n\n\n[/col]\n[col span=\"6\" span__sm=\"12\"]\n\n[ux_text class=\"sub-title\"]\n\nVề chúng tôi\n[/ux_text]\n[ux_text font_size__sm=\"1.5\" class=\"main-title\"]\n\n<h2>Kế hoạch du lịch của chúng tôi là thực hiện ước mơ của bạn</h2>\n[/ux_text]\n<p>Hiểu rằng để đạt được bất cứ điều gì đều cần có niềm tin và niềm tin vào bản thân, tầm nhìn, sự chăm chỉ, quyết tâm và cống hiến.Hiểu rằng để đạt được bất cứ điều gì đều cần có niềm tin và niềm tin vào bản thân, tầm nhìn, sự chăm chỉ, quyết tâm và cống hiến.</p>\n\n[/col]\n\n[/row]\n[gap height=\"60px\"]\n\n[section bg_color=\"rgb(245, 245, 245)\" padding=\"0px\"]\n\n[gap height=\"100px\"]\n\n[row v_align=\"middle\"]\n\n[col span=\"5\" span__sm=\"12\"]\n\n[ux_image id=\"73\" margin=\"0px 0px -30px 0px\"]\n\n\n[/col]\n[col span=\"7\" span__sm=\"12\" padding=\"0px 0px 0px 50px\" padding__sm=\"0px 0px 0px 0px\" padding__md=\"0px 0px 0px 20px\"]\n\n[ux_text class=\"sub-title\"]\n\nWHY CHOOSE US\n[/ux_text]\n[ux_text class=\"main-title\"]\n\n<h2>TẠI SAO CHỌN CHÚNG TÔI</h2>\n[/ux_text]\n<p>Lorem Ipsum is simply dummy text of the printing and typesetting industry. Lorem Ipsum has been the industry\'s standard dummy text ever since the 1500s, when an unknow n printer took a galley of type and scrambled it to make a type specimen book. It has survived not only five centuries, a type specimen book.</p>\n<p>It has survived not only five centuries,a type specimen book. It has survived not only five centuries,</p>\n\n[/col]\n\n[/row]\n\n[/section]\n[row]\n\n[col span__sm=\"12\" margin=\"50px 0px 0px 0px\"]\n\n[ux_text text_align=\"center\" class=\"uppercase main-title\"]\n\n<h2>Đối tác của chúng tôi</h2>\n[/ux_text]\n[ux_gallery ids=\"79,8