 was well organized, the hotels were comfortable, and the guide was extremely professional. Everything exceeded our expectations.”</p>\n\n[/testimonial]\n\n[/col]\n[col span=\"4\" span__sm=\"12\"]\n\n[testimonial image=\"898\" image_width=\"121\" name=\"Sophia Miller\" company=\"Canada\"]\n\n<p>“The Ha Long Bay cruise arranged by Vionis Travel was unforgettable. From transportation to activities, every detail was carefully prepared. Highly recommended for anyone visiting Vietnam.”</p>\n\n[/testimonial]\n\n[/col]\n[col span=\"4\" span__sm=\"12\"]\n\n[testimonial image=\"1627\" image_width=\"121\" name=\"Daniel Kim\" company=\"South Korea\"]\n\n<p>“Our family trip to Vietnam was fantastic thanks to Vionis Travel. Every part of the journey was organized professionally, from airport transfers to sightseeing activities. The team was responsive, reliable, and always available whenever we needed assistance. It was one of the best travel experiences we’ve ever had.”</p>\n\n[/testimonial]\n\n[/col]\n\n[/row]\n\n[/section]\n[row]\n\n[col span__sm=\"12\"]\n\n[ux_text font_size=\"2\" font_size__sm=\"1.45\" font_size__md=\"1.35\" text_align=\"center\" class=\"phongvt-title-main h2\"]\n\n<h3>Travel Guide</h3>\n[/ux_text]\n[blog_posts style=\"normal\" columns=\"3\" columns__md=\"1\" slider_nav_style=\"simple\" badge_style=\"square\" excerpt_length=\"26\" show_category=\"text\" image_height=\"65.25%\" image_radius=\"4\" image_size=\"original\" image_hover=\"zoom\" text_align=\"left\"]\n\n\n[/col]\n\n[/row]\n[section bg=\"1633\" bg_size=\"original\" bg_overlay=\"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4)\" bg_pos=\"70% 60%\" border=\"0px 0px 0px 0px\" border_margin=\"0px 0px 0px 0px\"]\n\n[gap height=\"90px\" visibility=\"hide-for-medium\"]\n\n[row]\n\n[col span__sm=\"12\" class=\"vis\"]\n\n[ux_text text_align=\"center\" class=\"trust\"]\n\n<h2>Every Great Journey Starts with Trust</h2>\n<h4 class=\"thin-font\">Read reviews about us on</h4>\n[/ux_text]\n\n[/col]\n\n[/row]\n[row width=\"custom\" h_align=\"center\"]\n\n[col span=\"10\" span__sm=\"12\" span__md=\"12\"]\n\n[row_inner h_align=\"center\"]\n\n[col_inner span=\"2\" span__sm=\"7\" span__md=\"3\" padding=\"30px 30px 30px 30px\" bg_color=\"rgb(255, 255, 255)\" border=\"0px 0px 0px 0px\"]\n\n[ux_image id=\"1611\"]\n\n\n[/col_inner]\n[col_inner span=\"2\" span__sm=\"7\" span__md=\"3\" padding=\"30px 30px 30px 30px\" bg_color=\"rgb(255, 255, 255)\" border=\"0px 0px 0px 0px\"]\n\n[ux_image id=\"1616\" link=\"https://share.google/cJWr03bpmlOJfILIF\"]\n\n\n[/col_inner]\n\n[/row_inner]\n\n[/col]\n\n[/row]\n\n[/section]\n[section bg=\"563\" bg_size=\"original\" bg_overlay=\"rgba(238, 224, 224, 0.331)\" bg_pos=\"57% 0%\" border=\"0px 0px 0px 0px\" visibility=\"hidden\"]\n\n[row]\n\n[col span__sm=\"12\" margin=\"0px 0px -40px 0px\"]\n\n[row_inner]\n\n[col_inner span=\"7\" span__sm=\"12\" class=\"appointment\"]\n\n[gap height=\"90px\" visibility=\"hide-for-medium\"]\n\n[gap visibility=\"show-for-small\"]\n\n[ux_text text_align=\"center\" class=\"phongvt-title-main h2\"]\n\n<h2>Connect with Vionis Travel</h2>\n[/ux_text]\n[contact-form-7 id=\"87\"]\n\n\n[/col_inner]\n[col_inner span=\"5\" span__sm=\"12\" class=\"appointment\"]\n\n[ux_image id=\"912\" image_size=\"original\" class=\"phongvt-hieu-ung-toa-hinh\"]\n\n\n[/col_inner]\n\n[/row_inner]\n\n[/col]\n\n[/row]\n\n[/section]', 'Homepage', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '1138-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-07-14 09:18:22', '2026-07-14 02:18:22', '', 1138, 'https://vionistravel.com/?p=1771', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(1772, 7, '2026-07-14 09:22:44', '2026-07-14 02:22:44', '{\n    \"custom_css[flatsome-child]\": {\n        \"value\": \"\\n\\n/* B\\u1ecf uppercase to\\u00e0n b\\u1ed9 menu dropdown */\\n.nav-dropdown a,\\n.nav-dropdown ul a,\\n.nav-dropdown li > a,\\n.nav-dropdown .nav-dropdown-col > a,\\n.nav-dropdown .sub-menu a,\\n.nav-dropdown .nav-column a{\\n    text-transform: none !important;\\n}\\n\\n/*css danh m\\u1ee5c tour*/\\n.vionis-tour-card h3 {\\n\\tfont-size: 30px !important;\\n}\\n\\n.vionis-tour-card h3 {\\n    line-height: 38px !important;\\n}\\n\\n/*css header*/\\n#header .header-nav-main>.menu-item>a{\\n\\tfont-size: 15px !important;\\n}\\n.header-nav-main>li {\\n    margin: 0 10px !important;\\n}\\n\\n.trust h2,\\n.trust h4{\\n\\tcolor: white;\\n}\\n\\n/*css contact form about*/\\n.page-id-59 #wpcf7-f87-p59-o1 .wpcf7-text,\\n.page-id-59 #wpcf7-f87-p59-o1 .wpcf7-email,\\n.page-id-59 #wpcf7-f87-p59-o1 .wpcf7-tel,\\n.page-id-59 #wpcf7-f87-p59-o1 .wpcf7-textarea {\\n    color: var(--primary-color);\\n}\\n\\n/*css menu header*/\\n.nav-left {\\n    justify-content: center;\\n}\\n/*css menu header*/\\n\\n/*css social footer*/\\n.footer-social{\\n    display:flex;\\n    gap:10px;\\n    align-items:center;\\n    flex-wrap:wrap;\\n}\\n\\n.footer-social a{\\n    width:40px;\\n    height:40px;\\n    border-radius:50%;\\n    background:#2b322d;\\n    color:#fff;\\n    display:flex;\\n    align-items:center;\\n    justify-content:center;\\n    text-decoration:none;\\n    transition:all .3s ease;\\n}\\n\\n.footer-social a:hover{\\n    background:#127faf;\\n    transform:translateY(-2px);\\n}\\n\\n.footer-social a i{\\n    font-size:18px;\\n    line-height:1;\\n}\\n\\n.footer-social a img{\\n    width:22px;\\n    height:22px;\\n    object-fit:contain;\\n    display:block;\\n}\\n/*css social footer*/\\n\\n.html_nav_position_text {\\n    margin-right: 0 !important;\\n}\\n\\n/*css 1/6/2026*/\\n.main-title * {\\n    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 5vw, 3rem); /* 28px -> 48px */\\n    font-weight: bold;\\n}\\n\\n.mobile {\\n    display: none;\\n}\\n\\n@media (max-width: 767px) {\\n    .mobile {\\n        display: block;\\n    }\\n}\\n\\n.gtranslate-custom {\\n    text-align: right;\\n}\\n\\n.lightbox-content {\\n    padding: 30px 30px 10px 30px !important;\\n}\\n\\n/*css 1/6/2026*/\\n\\n/* Giao di\\u1ec7n GTranslate */\\n.gtranslate-custom select {\\n    background-color: #ffffff;\\n    color: #222;\\n    border: 1px solid #ddd;\\n    border-radius: 8px;\\n    padding: 6px 10px;\\n    font-size: 15px;\\n    box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);\\n    cursor: pointer;\\n    transition: all 0.3s ease;\\n}\\n\\n/* Hover select */\\n.gtranslate-custom select:hover {\\n    border-color: #0073e6;\\n    background-color: #f0f8ff;\\n}\\n\\n/* Link ng\\u00f4n ng\\u1eef */\\n.gtranslate-custom a {\\n    display: inline-flex;\\n    align-items: center;\\n    text-decoration: none;\\n    padding: 6px 10px;\\n    margin: 5px 3px;\\n    background: #f9f9f9;\\n    color: #333;\\n    border: 1px solid #ddd;\\n    border-radius: 6px;\\n    font-size: 14px;\\n    transition: all 0.3s;\\n}\\n\\n/* Icon c\\u1edd qu\\u1ed1c gia trong link */\\n.gtranslate-custom a img {\\n    width: 20px;\\n    height: 14px;\\n    margin-right: 5px;\\n    object-fit: cover;\\n}\\n\\n/* Hover link */\\n.gtranslate-custom a:hover {\\n    background: #0073e6;\\n    color: #fff;\\n    border-color: #0073e6;\\n}\\n\\n/* Responsive Mobile */\\n@media (max-width: 768px) {\\n    .gtranslate-custom {\\n        display: flex;\\n        justify-content: center; /* C\\u0103n gi\\u1eefa */\\n        align-items: center;\\n        flex-wrap: nowrap; /* Kh\\u00f4ng cho xu\\u1ed1ng h\\u00e0ng */\\n        gap: 5px;\\n    }\\n    .gtranslate-custom a {\\n        flex: 0 0 auto;\\n        padding: 4px 8px;\\n        font-size: 13px;\\n    }\\n    .gtranslate-custom a img {\\n        width: 16px; /* Icon nh\\u1ecf h\\u01a1n */\\n        height: 12px;\\n        margin-right: 3px;\\n    }\\n}\\n\\n.has-hover .bg,\\n.has-hover [class*=image-] img {\\n    transition: filter 0.6s ease, opacity 0.6s ease, transform 0.6s ease, box-shadow 0.4s ease;\\n    transform-origin: center center;\\n}\\n\\n/* Khi hover */\\n.has-hover:hover .bg,\\n.has-hover:hover [class*=image-] img {\\n    transform: scale(1.03) rotateZ(0.3deg) translateY(-2px); /* chuy\\u1ec3n \\u0111\\u1ed9ng nh\\u1eb9 l\\u00ean */\\n    filter: brightness(1.2) contrast(1.1) saturate(1.2); /* gi\\u1ea3m \\u0111\\u1ed9 s\\u00e1ng v\\u00e0 b\\u00e3o h\\u00f2a */\\n    box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4), \\n                0 0 40px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3), \\n                0 0 60px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2), \\n                0 5px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1); /* b\\u00f3ng \\u0111\\u1ed5 m\\u1ec1m */\\n    opacity: 1;\\n}\\n\\n\\n\\n.box-text a:not(.button),\\n.box-text h4,\\n.box-text h5,\\n.box-text h6 {\\n    line-height: 1.3;\\n    color: rgb(211 27 27);\\n    margin-bottom: .1em;\\n    margin-top: .1em;\\n    transition: color 0.3s ease, transform 0.3s ease;\\n}\\n\\n.box-text a:not(.button):hover,\\n.box-text h4:hover,\\n.box-text h5:hover,\\n.box-text h6:hover {\\n    color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\\n    transform: translateY(-3px);\\n    cursor: pointer;\\n}\\n\\n\\n\\n.home_blog .box-blog-post:hover {\\n    box-shadow: 0 0px 22px #84c8ff;\\n    transform: scale(1.02);\\n    padding: 10px 20px;\\n    text-align: left;\\n}\\n.home_blog .box-blog-post {\\n    box-shadow: 0 0 18px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);\\n    border-radius: 10px; /* Bo g\\u00f3c */\\n    transition: all 0.s ease;\\n}\\n.home_blog .box-blog-post:hover {\\n    box-shadow: 0 0px 5px #84c8ff;\\n    transform: scale(1.02);\\n    padding: 10px 20px;\\n    text-align: left;\\n    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05); /* Gi\\u1eef vi\\u1ec1n khi hover */\\n}\\n\\n\\n.tour-outbound {\\n    padding: 4.18rem var(--section) 8.81rem;\\n    background: var(--Linear, linear-gradient(90deg, var(--Color, #023F88) 0%, var(--Color-2, #0071BB) 100%));\\n    display: flex\\n;\\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\\n    justify-content: space-between;\\n}\\n\\n.tour-outbound .tour-outbound__title h2 {\\n    color: #fff;\\n    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);\\n    font-style: normal;\\n    font-weight: 700;\\n    line-height: 1.2;\\n    text-transform: uppercase;\\n}\\n\\n.home-introduce .home-introduce__title h1 {\\n    margin-bottom: 1.06rem;\\n}\\n\\n.phongvt-title-main h2,\\n.phongvt-title-main h1,\\n.phongvt-title-main h3,\\n.phongvt-title-main-p p {\\n    object-position: 50% 50%;\\n    color: var(--Color, #06346c);\\n    font-size: 3.5rem;\\n    font-style: normal;\\n    font-weight: 700;\\n    line-height: normal;\\n    text-transform: uppercase;\\n}\\n\\n/* Tablet */\\n@media (max-width: 991px) {\\n    .phongvt-title-main h2,\\n    .phongvt-title-main h1,\\n    .phongvt-title-main h3,\\n    .phongvt-title-main-p p {\\n        font-size: 2.5rem;\\n    }\\n}\\n\\n/* Mobile */\\n@media (max-width: 767px) {\\n    .phongvt-title-main h2,\\n    .phongvt-title-main h1,\\n    .phongvt-title-main h3,\\n    .phongvt-title-main-p p {\\n        font-size: 1.8rem;\\n        line-height: 1.3;\\n    }\\n}\\n\\n\\n\\n.tour-outbound {\\n    padding: 4.18rem var(--section) 8.81rem;\\n    background: var(--Linear, linear-gradient(90deg, var(--Color, #023F88) 0%, var(--Color-2, #0071BB) 100%));\\n    display: flex\\n;\\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\\n    justify-content: space-between;\\n}\\n\\n.fix-section {\\n    border-radius: 2.75rem 2.75rem 0rem 0rem;\\n    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #01549D 0%, var(--Color-2, #0071BB) 60.5%);\\n    padding: 4.44rem var(--section) 16.45rem;\\n    overflow: hidden;\\n}\\n\\n\\n.appointment .item label {\\n    font-size: 14px;\\n    font-weight: 500;\\n    position: absolute;\\n    z-index: 1;\\n    background: #fff;\\n    left: 10px;\\n\\n    padding: 0 10px;\\n    display: inline-block;\\n    width: auto;\\n    border-radius: 8px;\\n    color: #333;\\n}\\n.appointment {\\n    background: #fff;\\n    position: relative;\\n    z-index: 1;\\n}\\n\\n\\n#header .header-nav-main>.menu-item>a {\\n    color: #404040;\\n    font-size: 1.1rem;\\n    font-style: normal;\\n\\ttransition: color 0.3s ease;\\n    font-weight: 600;\\n    line-height: 1.35rem;\\n    padding: var(--30) 0;\\n}\\n#header .header-nav-main > .menu-item.current-menu-item > a {\\n    color: #023f88; /* M\\u00e0u xanh d\\u01b0\\u01a1ng */\\n}\\n#header .header-nav-main > .menu-item > a:hover {\\n    color: #023f88; /* M\\u00e0u xanh d\\u01b0\\u01a1ng */\\n}\\n\\n\\n.phongvt-hieu-ung-toa-hinh {\\n    display: block;\\n    position: relative;\\n    overflow: hidden\\n}\\n\\n.phongvt-hieu-ung-toa-hinh:before {\\n    position: absolute;\\n    top: 50%;\\n    left: 50%;\\n    z-index: 2;\\n    display: block;\\n    content: \'\';\\n    width: 0;\\n    height: 0;\\n    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.2);\\n    border-radius: 100%;\\n    opacity: 0;\\n    -webkit-transform: translate(-50%, -50%);\\n    -ms-transform: translate(-50%, -50%);\\n    -o-transform: translate(-50%, -50%);\\n    transform: translate(-50%, -50%)\\n}\\n\\n@media (min-width: 1025px) {\\n    .phongvt-hieu-ung-toa-hinh:hover:before {\\n        -webkit-animation:circle 0.75s;\\n        -ms-animation: circle 0.75s;\\n        -o-animation: circle 0.75s;\\n        animation: circle 0.75s\\n    }\\n}\\n\\n@-ms-keyframes circle {\\n    0% {\\n        opacity: 1\\n    }\\n\\n    40% {\\n        opacity: 1\\n    }\\n\\n    100% {\\n        width: 200%;\\n        height: 200%;\\n        opacity: 0\\n    }\\n}\\n\\n@-o-keyframes circle {\\n    0% {\\n        opacity: 1\\n    }\\n\\n    40% {\\n        opacity: 1\\n    }\\n\\n    100% {\\n        width: 200%;\\n        height: 200%;\\n        opacity: 0\\n    }\\n}\\n\\n@-webkit-keyframes circle {\\n    0% {\\n        opacity: 1\\n    }\\n\\n    40% {\\n        opacity: 1\\n    }\\n\\n    100% {\\n        width: 200%;\\n        height: 200%;\\n        opacity: 0\\n    }\\n}\\n\\n@keyframes circle {\\n    0% {\\n        opacity: 1\\n    }\\n\\n    40% {\\n        opacity: 1\\n    }\\n\\n    100% {\\n        width: 200%;\\n        height: 200%;\\n        opacity: 0\\n    }\\n}\",\n        \"type\": \"custom_css\",\n        \"user_id\": 7,\n        \"date_modified_gmt\": \"2026-07-14 02:22:44\"\n    }\n}', '', '', 'trash', 'closed', 'closed', '', '47716618-4c02-4827-b1df-8ce61caef705', '', '', '2026-07-14 09:22:44', '2026-07-14 02:22:44', '', 0, 'https://vionistravel.com/?p=1772', 0, 'customize_changeset', '', 0),
(1773, 7, '2026-07-14 09:22:44', '2026-07-14 02:22:44', '\n\n/* Bỏ uppercase toàn bộ menu dropdown */\n.nav-dropdown a,\n.nav-dropdown ul a,\n.nav-dropdown li > a,\n.nav-dropdown .nav-dropdown-col > a,\n.nav-dropdown .sub-menu a,\n.nav-dropdown .nav-column a{\n    text-transform: none !important;\n}\n\n/*css danh mục tour*/\n.vionis-tour-card h3 {\n	font-size: 30px !important;\n}\n\n.vionis-tour-card h3 {\n    line-height: 38px !important;\n}\n\n/*css header*/\n#header .header-nav-main>.menu-item>a{\n	font-size: 15px !important;\n}\n.header-nav-main>li {\n    margin: 0 10px !important;\n}\n\n.trust h2,\n.trust h4{\n	color: white;\n}\n\n/*css contact form about*/\n.page-id-59 #wpcf7-f87-p59-o1 .wpcf7-text,\n.page-id-59 #wpcf7-f87-p59-o1 .wpcf7-email,\n.page-id-59 #wpcf7-f87-p59-o1 .wpcf7-tel,\n.page-id-59 #wpcf7-f87-p59-o1 .wpcf7-textarea {\n    color: var(--primary-color);\n}\n\n/*css menu header*/\n.nav-left {\n    justify-content: center;\n}\n/*css menu header*/\n\n/*css social footer*/\n.footer-social{\n    display:flex;\n    gap:10px;\n    align-items:center;\n    flex-wrap:wrap;\n}\n\n.footer-social a{\n    width:40px;\n    height:40px;\n    border-radius:50%;\n    background:#2b322d;\n    color:#fff;\n    display:flex;\n    align-items:center;\n    justify-content:center;\n    text-decoration:none;\n    transition:all .3s ease;\n}\n\n.footer-social a:hover{\n    background:#127faf;\n    transform:translateY(-2px);\n}\n\n.footer-social a i{\n    font-size:18px;\n    line-height:1;\n}\n\n.footer-social a img{\n    width:22px;\n    height:22px;\n    object-fit:contain;\n    display:block;\n}\n/*css social footer*/\n\n.html_nav_position_text {\n    margin-right: 0 !important;\n}\n\n/*css 1/6/2026*/\n.main-title * {\n    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 5vw, 3rem); /* 28px -> 48px */\n    font-weight: bold;\n}\n\n.mobile {\n    display: none;\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 767px) {\n    .mobile {\n        display: block;\n    }\n}\n\n.gtranslate-custom {\n    text-align: right;\n}\n\n.lightbox-content {\n    padding: 30px 30px 10px 30px !important;\n}\n\n/*css 1/6/2026*/\n\n/* Giao diện GTranslate */\n.gtranslate-custom select {\n    background-color: #ffffff;\n    color: #222;\n    border: 1px solid #ddd;\n    border-radius: 8px;\n    padding: 6px 10px;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);\n    cursor: pointer;\n    transition: all 0.3s ease;\n}\n\n/* Hover select */\n.gtranslate-custom select:hover {\n    border-color: #0073e6;\n    background-color: #f0f8ff;\n}\n\n/* Link ngôn ngữ */\n.gtranslate-custom a {\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    text-decoration: none;\n    padding: 6px 10px;\n    margin: 5px 3px;\n    background: #f9f9f9;\n    color: #333;\n    border: 1px solid #ddd;\n    border-radius: 6px;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    transition: all 0.3s;\n}\n\n/* Icon cờ quốc gia trong link */\n.gtranslate-custom a img {\n    width: 20px;\n    height: 14px;\n    margin-right: 5px;\n    object-fit: cover;\n}\n\n/* Hover link */\n.gtranslate-custom a:hover {\n    background: #0073e6;\n    color: #fff;\n    border-color: #0073e6;\n}\n\n/* Responsive Mobile */\n@media (max-width: 768px) {\n    .gtranslate-custom {\n        display: flex;\n        justify-content: center; /* Căn giữa */\n        align-items: center;\n        flex-wrap: nowrap; /* Không cho xuống hàng */\n        gap: 5px;\n    }\n    .gtranslate-custom a {\n        flex: 0 0 auto;\n        padding: 4px 8px;\n        font-size: 13px;\n    }\n    .gtranslate-custom a img {\n        width: 16px; /* Icon nhỏ hơn */\n        height: 12px;\n        margin-right: 3px;\n    }\n}\n\n.has-hover .bg,\n.has-hover [class*=image-] img {\n    transition: filter 0.6s ease, opacity 0.6s ease, transform 0.6s ease, box-shadow 0.4s ease;\n    transform-origin: center center;\n}\n\n/* Khi hover */\n.has-hover:hover .bg,\n.has-hover:hover [class*=image-] img {\n    transform: scale(1.03) rotateZ(0.3deg) translateY(-2px); /* chuyển động nhẹ lên */\n    filter: brightness(1.2) contrast(1.1) saturate(1.2); /* giảm độ sáng và bão hòa */\n    box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4), \n                0 0 40px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3), \n                0 0 60px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2), \n                0 5px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1); /* bóng đổ mềm */\n    opacity: 1;\n}\n\n\n\n.box-text a:not(.button),\n.box-text h4,\n.box-text h5,\n.box-text h6 {\n    line-height: 1.3;\n    color: rgb(211 27 27);\n    margin-bottom: .1em;\n    margin-top: .1em;\n    transition: color 0.3s ease, transform 0.3s ease;\n}\n\n.box-text a:not(.button):hover,\n.box-text h4:hover,\n.box-text h5:hover,\n.box-text h6:hover {\n    color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\n    transform: translateY(-3px);\n    cursor: pointer;\n}\n\n\n\n.home_blog .box-blog-post:hover {\n    box-shadow: 0 0px 22px #84c8ff;\n    transform: scale(1.02);\n    padding: 10px 20px;\n    text-align: left;\n}\n.home_blog .box-blog-post {\n    box-shadow: 0 0 18px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);\n    border-radius: 10px; /* Bo góc */\n    transition: all 0.s ease;\n}\n.home_blog .box-blog-post:hover {\n    box-shadow: 0 0px 5px #84c8ff;\n    transform: scale(1.02);\n    padding: 10px 20px;\n    text-align: left;\n    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05); /* Giữ viền khi hover */\n}\n\n\n.tour-outbound {\n    padding: 4.18rem var(--section) 8.81rem;\n    background: var(--Linear, linear-gradient(90deg, var(--Color, #023F88) 0%, var(--Color-2, #0071BB) 100%));\n    display: flex\n;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n}\n\n.tour-outbound .tour-outbound__title h2 {\n    color: #fff;\n    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);\n    font-style: normal;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    line-height: 1.2;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n}\n\n.home-introduce .home-introduce__title h1 {\n    margin-bottom: 1.06rem;\n}\n\n.phongvt-title-main h2,\n.phongvt-title-main h1,\n.phongvt-title-main h3,\n.phongvt-title-main-p p {\n    object-position: 50% 50%;\n    color: var(--Color, #06346c);\n    font-size: 3.5rem;\n    font-style: normal;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    line-height: normal;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n}\n\n/* Tablet */\n@media (max-width: 991px) {\n    .phongvt-title-main h2,\n    .phongvt-title-main h1,\n    .phongvt-title-main h3,\n    .phongvt-title-main-p p {\n        font-size: 2.5rem;\n    }\n}\n\n/* Mobile */\n@media (max-width: 767px) {\n    .phongvt-title-main h2,\n    .phongvt-title-main h1,\n    .phongvt-title-main h3,\n    .phongvt-title-main-p p {\n        font-size: 1.8rem;\n        line-height: 1.3;\n    }\n}\n\n\n\n.tour-outbound {\n    padding: 4.18rem var(--section) 8.81rem;\n    background: var(--Linear, linear-gradient(90deg, var(--Color, #023F88) 0%, var(--Color-2, #0071BB) 100%));\n    display: flex\n;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n}\n\n.fix-section {\n    border-radius: 2.75rem 2.75rem 0rem 0rem;\n    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #01549D 0%, var(--Color-2, #0071BB) 60.5%);\n    padding: 4.44rem var(--section) 16.45rem;\n    overflow: hidden;\n}\n\n\n.appointment .item label {\n    font-size: 14px;\n    font-weight: 500;\n    position: absolute;\n    z-index: 1;\n    background: #fff;\n    left: 10px;\n\n    padding: 0 10px;\n    display: inline-block;\n    width: auto;\n    border-radius: 8px;\n    color: #333;\n}\n.appointment {\n    background: #fff;\n    position: relative;\n    z-index: 1;\n}\n\n\n#header .header-nav-main>.menu-item>a {\n    color: #404040;\n    font-size: 1.1rem;\n    font-style: normal;\n	transition: color 0.3s ease;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    line-height: 1.35rem;\n    padding: var(--30) 0;\n}\n#header .header-nav-main > .menu-item.current-menu-item > a {\n    color: #023f88; /* Màu xanh dương */\n}\n#header .header-nav-main > .menu-item > a:hover {\n    color: #023f88; /* Màu xanh dương */\n}\n\n\n.phongvt-hieu-ung-toa-hinh {\n    display: block;\n    position: relative;\n    overflow: hidden\n}\n\n.phongvt-hieu-ung-toa-hinh:before {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 50%;\n    left: 50%;\n    z-index: 2;\n    display: block;\n    content: \'\';\n    width: 0;\n    height: 0;\n    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.2);\n    border-radius: 100%;\n    opacity: 0;\n    -webkit-transform: translate(-50%, -50%);\n    -ms-transform: translate(-50%, -50%);\n    -o-transform: translate(-50%, -50%);\n    transform: translate(-50%, -50%)\n}\n\n@media (min-width: 1025px) {\n    .phongvt-hieu-ung-toa-hinh:hover:before {\n        -webkit-animation:circle 0.75s;\n        -ms-animation: circle 0.75s;\n        -o-animation: circle 0.75s;\n        animation: circle 0.75s\n    }\n}\n\n@-ms-keyframes circle {\n    0% {\n        opacity: 1\n    }\n\n    40% {\n        opacity: 1\n    }\n\n    100% {\n        width: 200%;\n        height: 200%;\n        opacity: 0\n    }\n}\n\n@-o-keyframes circle {\n    0% {\n        opacity: 1\n    }\n\n    40% {\n        opacity: 1\n    }\n\n    100% {\n        width: 200%;\n        height: 200%;\n        opacity: 0\n    }\n}\n\n@-webkit-keyframes circle {\n    0% {\n        opacity: 1\n    }\n\n    40% {\n        opacity: 1\n    }\n\n    100% {\n        width: 200%;\n        height: 200%;\n        opacity: 0\n    }\n}\n\n@keyframes circle {\n    0% {\n        opacity: 1\n    }\n\n    40% {\n        opacity: 1\n    }\n\n    100% {\n        width: 200%;\n        height: 200%;\n        opacity: 0\n    }\n}', 'flatsome-child', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '852-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-07-14 09:22:44', '2026-07-14 02:22:44', '', 852, 'https://vionistravel.com/?p=1773', 0, 'revision', '', 0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` (`ID`, `post_author`, `post_date`, `post_date_gmt`, `post_content`, `post_title`, `post_excerpt`, `post_status`, `comment_status`, `ping_status`, `post_password`, `post_name`, `to_ping`, `pinged`, `post_modified`, `post_modified_gmt`, `post_content_filtered`, `post_parent`, `guid`, `menu_order`, `post_type`, `post_mime_type`, `comment_count`) VALUES
(1774, 7, '2026-07-14 09:23:29', '2026-07-14 02:23:29', '[section bg=\"1753\" bg_size=\"original\" bg_pos=\"37% 63%\" dark=\"true\" padding=\"0px\" height=\"70vh\" height__sm=\"100vh\" height__md=\"60vh\" video_mp4=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/VIONIS-VIETNAM-TRAVEL-NEW.mp4\" video_visibility=\"visible\"]\n\n[row]\n\n[col span__sm=\"12\" align=\"center\"]\n\n[ux_text font_size=\"3\" font_size__sm=\"2\" text_align=\"center\" class=\"extra mg0\"]\n\n<strong>Vionis Travel – Your trusted travel partner for every journey. </strong>\n[/ux_text]\n[ux_text font_size=\"2.5\" font_size__sm=\"1\"]\n\nYour Perfect Trip Starts Here\n[/ux_text]\n[row_inner]\n\n[col_inner span=\"3\" span__sm=\"12\"]\n\n\n[/col_inner]\n[col_inner span=\"6\" span__sm=\"12\"]\n\n[search style=\"flat\" size=\"xlarge\" visibility=\"hidden\"]\n\n[ux_html]\n\n[tour_search_filter]\n[/ux_html]\n\n[/col_inner]\n[col_inner span=\"3\" span__sm=\"12\"]\n\n\n[/col_inner]\n\n[/row_inner]\n\n[/col]\n\n[/row]\n\n[/section]\n[section bg_color=\"rgba(18, 127, 175, 0.064)\"]\n\n[row]\n\n[col span__sm=\"12\" margin=\"30px 0px 0px 0px\"]\n\n[ux_html visibility=\"hidden\"]\n\n<style>\n/*=========================\n    FEATURES\n=========================*/\n.vionis-features{\n    display:grid;\n    grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);\n    background:#fff;\n    border-radius:18px;\n    overflow:hidden;\n    box-shadow:0 10px 35px rgba(0,0,0,.08);\n}\n\n.vionis-features .feature-item{\n    padding:34px 24px;\n    text-align:center;\n    border-right:1px solid #ececec;\n    transition:.3s;\n}\n\n.vionis-features .feature-item:last-child{\n    border-right:none;\n}\n\n.vionis-features .feature-item:hover{\n    background:#fafafa;\n}\n\n.vionis-features .feature-icon{\n    width:52px;\n    height:52px;\n    margin:0 auto 18px;\n    color:#d6a31b;\n}\n\n.vionis-features .feature-icon svg,\n.vionis-features .feature-icon img{\n    width:100%;\n    height:100%;\n    display:block;\n    object-fit:contain;\n}\n\n.vionis-features h4{\n    margin:0;\n    font-size:20px;\n    line-height:1.45;\n    font-weight:700;\n    color:#1d1d1d;\n}\n\n/* Tablet */\n\n@media (max-width:849px){\n\n    .vionis-features{\n        grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);\n    }\n\n    .vionis-features .feature-item:nth-child(2){\n        border-right:none;\n    }\n\n    .vionis-features .feature-item:nth-child(-n+2){\n        border-bottom:1px solid #ececec;\n    }\n\n}\n\n/* Mobile */\n\n@media (max-width:549px){\n\n    .vionis-features{\n        grid-template-columns:1fr;\n    }\n\n    .vionis-features .feature-item{\n        border-right:none;\n        border-bottom:1px solid #ececec;\n        padding:26px 20px;\n    }\n\n    .vionis-features .feature-item:last-child{\n        border-bottom:none;\n    }\n\n    .vionis-features h4{\n        font-size:17px;\n    }\n\n    .vionis-features .feature-icon{\n        width:44px;\n        height:44px;\n    }\n\n}\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"vionis-features\">\n\n    <!-- Feature 1 -->\n    <div class=\"feature-item\">\n        <div class=\"feature-icon\">\n            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\">\n                <path d=\"M12 21s7-5.5 7-11a7 7 0 10-14 0c0 5.5 7 11 7 11z\"/>\n                <circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"2.5\"/>\n            </svg>\n        </div>\n        <h4>Handpicked Tours<br>& Activities</h4>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Feature 2 -->\n    <div class=\"feature-item\">\n        <div class=\"feature-icon\">\n            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\">\n                <path d=\"M12 3l7 3v5c0 5-3.5 8-7 10-3.5-2-7-5-7-10V6l7-3z\"/>\n                <path d=\"M9 12l2 2 4-4\"/>\n            </svg>\n        </div>\n        <h4>Easy & Secure<br>Booking</h4>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Feature 3 -->\n    <div class=\"feature-item\">\n        <div class=\"feature-icon\">\n            <img src=\"https://vionistravel.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/price-tag-color.svg\"\n                 alt=\"Price Tag\">\n        </div>\n        <h4>Competitive &<br>Transparent Pricing</h4>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Feature 4 -->\n    <div class=\"feature-item\">\n        <div class=\"feature-icon\">\n            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\">\n                <path d=\"M4 12a8 8 0 0116 0\"/>\n                <path d=\"M4 12v5\"/>\n                <path d=\"M20 12v5\"/>\n                <rect x=\"2\" y=\"16\" width=\"4\" height=\"5\" rx=\"1\"/>\n                <rect x=\"18\" y=\"16\" width=\"4\" height=\"5\" rx=\"1\"/>\n            </svg>\n        </div>\n        <h4>Flexible Cancellation &<br>24/7 Customer Support</h4>\n    </div>\n\n</div>\n[/ux_html]\n[ux_text text_align=\"center\" text_color=\"rgb(189, 150, 46)\"]\n\n<h2 class=\"uppercase\" style:\"color:#A58E6E;\">Our Best</h2>\n\n[/ux_text]\n[ux_text text_align=\"center\"]\n\n<div class=\"phongvt-title-main\">\n<h2 style=\"margin:0 !important;\">Tours & Packages</h2>\n</div>\n\n[/ux_text]\n[ux_text text_align=\"center\"]\n\n<h3 class=\"thin-font\">Explore Vietnam from North to South</h3>\n\n[/ux_text]\n[gap]\n\n[ux_product_categories style=\"default\" columns__sm=\"1\" slider_nav_style=\"circle\" slider_nav_position=\"outside\" ids=\"43,44,45,53\" orderby=\"name\" show_count=\"0\" image_width=\"33\" image_size=\"original\" text_align=\"left\" visibility=\"hidden\"]\n\n[vionis_tour_categories ids=\"43,44,45,53\"]\n\n\n[/col]\n\n[/row]\n[row width=\"custom\" custom_width=\"1700px\"]\n\n[col span__sm=\"12\" margin=\"30px 0px 0px 0px\"]\n\n[ux_text font_size=\"2\" font_size__sm=\"1.45\" font_size__md=\"1.35\" text_align=\"left\" class=\"phongvt-title-main h2\"]\n\n<h2>Explore Yacht Cruise Tours</h2>\n\n[/ux_text]\n[ux_products style=\"normal\" width=\"full-width\" columns__sm=\"1\" columns__md=\"2\" slider_nav_style=\"simple\" show_quick_view=\"0\" equalize_box=\"true\" cat=\"53\" image_height=\"75%\" image_size=\"original\" im