   <div class=\"feature-item\">\n    <div class=\"feature-icon\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"\n             style=\"transform:scaleX(-1)\">\n            <path d=\"M20.59 13.41l-7.17 7.17a2 2 0 01-2.83 0L2 12V2h10l8.59 8.59a2 2 0 010 2.82z\"/>\n            <circle cx=\"7\" cy=\"7\" r=\".5\" fill=\"currentColor\"/>\n        </svg>\n    </div>\n    <h4>Competitive &<br>Transparent Pricing</h4>\n</div>\n    <div class=\"feature-item\">\n        <div class=\"feature-icon\">\n            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\">\n                <path d=\"M4 12a8 8 0 0116 0\"/>\n                <path d=\"M4 12v5\"/><path d=\"M20 12v5\"/>\n                <rect x=\"2\" y=\"16\" width=\"4\" height=\"5\" rx=\"1\"/>\n                <rect x=\"18\" y=\"16\" width=\"4\" height=\"5\" rx=\"1\"/>\n            </svg>\n        </div>\n        <h4>Flexible Cancellation &<br>24/7 Customer Support</h4>\n    </div>\n</div>\n[/ux_html]\n[gap height=\"60px\" height__sm=\"40px\"]\n\n[ux_text text_align=\"center\" text_color=\"rgb(189, 150, 46)\"]\n\n<h2 class=\"uppercase\" style:\"color:#A58E6E;\">Our Best</h2>\n[/ux_text]\n[ux_text text_align=\"center\"]\n\n<div class=\"phongvt-title-main\">\n<h2 style=\"margin:0 !important;\">Tours & Packages</h2>\n</div>\n[/ux_text]\n[ux_text text_align=\"center\"]\n\n<h3 class=\"thin-font\">Explore Vietnam from North to South</h3>\n[/ux_text]\n[gap height__sm=\"10px\"]\n\n[ux_product_categories style=\"default\" columns__sm=\"1\" slider_nav_style=\"circle\" slider_nav_position=\"outside\" ids=\"43,44,45,53\" orderby=\"name\" show_count=\"0\" image_width=\"33\" image_size=\"original\" text_align=\"left\" visibility=\"hidden\"]\n\n[vionis_tour_categories ids=\"43,44,45,53\"]\n\n\n[/col]\n\n[/row]\n[row width=\"custom\" custom_width=\"1700px\"]\n\n[col label=\"tour-outbound\" span__sm=\"12\" margin=\"30px 0px 0px 0px\"]\n\n[ux_text font_size=\"2\" font_size__sm=\"1.45\" font_size__md=\"1.35\" text_align=\"left\" class=\"phongvt-title-main h2\"]\n\n<h2 style=\"margin:0;\">Explore Yacht Cruise Tours</h2>\n[/ux_text]\n[ux_text text_align=\"left\"]\n\n<h3 class=\"thin-font\">Luxury Cruises through Ha Long Bay & Lan Ha Bay</h3>\n[/ux_text]\n[gap]\n\n[ux_products style=\"normal\" width=\"full-width\" columns=\"3\" columns__sm=\"1\" columns__md=\"2\" slider_nav_style=\"simple\" show_quick_view=\"0\" equalize_box=\"true\" cat=\"53\" image_height=\"75%\" image_size=\"original\" image_hover=\"zoom\"]\n\n[gap height=\"20px\"]\n\n[button text=\"View more\" radius=\"99\" icon=\"icon-angle-right\" link=\"/danh-muc-san-pham/yacht-tour\" target=\"_blank\"]\n\n[gap]\n\n\n[/col]\n\n[/row]\n\n[/section]\n[section label=\"tour-outbound\" class=\"tour-outbound fix-section\"]\n\n[row]\n\n[col span__sm=\"12\" color=\"light\"]\n\n[gap]\n\n[ux_text font_size=\"1.5\" font_size__sm=\"1\" class=\"tour-outbound__title\"]\n\n<h2>North Vietnam Tours</h2>\n[/ux_text]\n[ux_text font_size=\"1.2\" font_size__sm=\"1\" line_height=\"1\"]\n\n<p>Where breathtaking landscapes meet a thousand years of rich cultural heritage.</p>\n[/ux_text]\n\n[/col]\n[col span__sm=\"12\"]\n\n[ux_products style=\"normal\" width=\"full-width\" columns=\"3\" columns__sm=\"1\" columns__md=\"2\" slider_nav_style=\"simple\" show_quick_view=\"0\" equalize_box=\"true\" cat=\"43\" cat_exclude=\"53\" image_height=\"75%\" image_size=\"original\" image_hover=\"zoom\"]\n\n[gap]\n\n[button text=\"Explore now\" radius=\"38\" icon=\"icon-angle-right\" link=\"/danh-muc-san-pham/north-vietnam\" target=\"_blank\"]\n\n\n[/col]\n\n[/row]\n\n[/section]\n[section label=\"tour-outbound\" bg=\"892\" bg_size=\"original\" bg_pos=\"36% 0%\"]\n\n[row]\n\n[col span__sm=\"12\" color=\"light\"]\n\n[gap]\n\n[ux_text font_size=\"1.5\" class=\"phongvt-title-main\"]\n\n<h2>Central VietNam Tours</h2>\n[/ux_text]\n[ux_text font_size=\"1.2\" line_height=\"0.75\" text_color=\"rgb(0,0,0)\"]\n\n<p>Where a thousand years of ancient heritage meet breathtaking coastlines.</p>\n[/ux_text]\n[gap]\n\n[ux_products style=\"normal\" width=\"full-width\" columns=\"3\" columns__sm=\"1\" columns__md=\"2\" slider_nav_style=\"simple\" show_quick_view=\"0\" equalize_box=\"true\" cat=\"44\" cat_exclude=\"53\" image_height=\"75%\" image_size=\"original\" image_hover=\"zoom\"]\n\n[gap]\n\n[button text=\"Explore now\" radius=\"38\" icon=\"icon-angle-right\" link=\"/danh-muc-san-pham/central-vietnam\" target=\"_blank\"]\n\n\n[/col]\n\n[/row]\n\n[/section]\n[section label=\"tour-outbound\" class=\"tour-outbound fix-section\"]\n\n[row]\n\n[col span__sm=\"12\" color=\"light\"]\n\n[gap]\n\n[ux_text font_size=\"1.5\" class=\"tour-outbound__title\"]\n\n<h2>South Vietnam Tours</h2>\n[/ux_text]\n[ux_text font_size=\"1.2\" line_height=\"1\"]\n\n<p>Where vibrant culture blends with tropical landscapes and the timeless beauty of the Mekong Delta.</p>\n\n[/ux_text]\n\n[/col]\n[col span__sm=\"12\"]\n\n[ux_products style=\"normal\" width=\"full-width\" columns=\"3\" columns__sm=\"1\" columns__md=\"2\" slider_nav_style=\"simple\" show_quick_view=\"0\" equalize_box=\"true\" cat=\"45\" cat_exclude=\"53\" image_height=\"75%\" image_size=\"original\" image_hover=\"zoom\"]\n\n[gap]\n\n[button text=\"Explore now\" radius=\"38\" icon=\"icon-angle-right\" link=\"/danh-muc-san-pham/south-vietnam\" target=\"_blank\"]\n\n\n[/col]\n\n[/row]\n\n[/section]\n[section bg=\"892\"]\n\n[row class=\"padding-bot\"]\n\n[col span__sm=\"12\" margin=\"40px 0px 0px 0px\"]\n\n[ux_text font_size=\"2\" font_size__sm=\"1.45\" font_size__md=\"1.35\" text_align=\"center\" class=\"phongvt-title-main h2\"]\n\n<h2>FEEDBACK FROM CUSTOMERS</h2>\n[/ux_text]\n\n[/col]\n\n[/row]\n[row]\n\n[col span=\"4\" span__sm=\"12\"]\n\n[testimonial image=\"1792\" image_width=\"121\" name=\"Emma Wilson\" company=\"Australia\"]\n\n<p>“Vionis Travel provided an outstanding Vietnam tour experience. The itinerary was well organized, the hotels were comfortable, and the guide was extremely professional. Everything exceeded our expectations.”</p>\n\n[/testimonial]\n\n[/col]\n[col span=\"4\" span__sm=\"12\"]\n\n[testimonial image=\"1793\" image_width=\"121\" name=\"Sophia Miller\" company=\"Canada\"]\n\n<p>“The Ha Long Bay cruise arranged by Vionis Travel was unforgettable. From transportation to activities, every detail was carefully prepared. Highly recommended for anyone visiting Vietnam.”</p>\n\n[/testimonial]\n\n[/col]\n[col span=\"4\" span__sm=\"12\"]\n\n[testimonial image=\"1794\" image_width=\"121\" name=\"Yuki Tanaka\" company=\"Japan\"]\n\n<p>“Our family trip to Vietnam was fantastic thanks to Vionis Travel. Every part of the journey was organized professionally, from airport transfers to sightseeing activities. The team was responsive, reliable, and always available whenever we needed assistance. It was one of the best travel experiences we’ve ever had.”</p>\n\n[/testimonial]\n\n[/col]\n\n[/row]\n\n[/section]\n[row]\n\n[col span__sm=\"12\"]\n\n[ux_text font_size=\"2\" font_size__sm=\"1.45\" font_size__md=\"1.35\" text_align=\"center\" class=\"phongvt-title-main h2\"]\n\n<h3>Travel Guide</h3>\n[/ux_text]\n[blog_posts style=\"normal\" columns=\"3\" columns__md=\"1\" slider_nav_style=\"simple\" badge_style=\"square\" excerpt_length=\"26\" show_category=\"text\" image_height=\"65.25%\" image_radius=\"4\" image_size=\"original\" image_hover=\"zoom\" text_align=\"left\"]\n\n\n[/col]\n\n[/row]\n[section bg=\"1633\" bg_size=\"original\" bg_overlay=\"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4)\" bg_pos=\"70% 60%\" border=\"0px 0px 0px 0px\" border_margin=\"0px 0px 0px 0px\"]\n\n[gap height=\"90px\" visibility=\"hide-for-medium\"]\n\n[row]\n\n[col span__sm=\"12\" class=\"vis\"]\n\n[ux_text text_align=\"center\" class=\"trust\"]\n\n<h2>Every Great Journey Starts with Trust</h2>\n<h4 class=\"thin-font\">Read reviews about us on</h4>\n[/ux_text]\n\n[/col]\n\n[/row]\n[row width=\"custom\" h_align=\"center\"]\n\n[col span=\"10\" span__sm=\"12\" span__md=\"12\"]\n\n[row_inner h_align=\"center\"]\n\n[col_inner span=\"2\" span__sm=\"7\" span__md=\"3\" padding=\"30px 30px 30px 30px\" bg_color=\"rgb(255, 255, 255)\" border=\"0px 0px 0px 0px\"]\n\n[ux_image id=\"1611\"]\n\n\n[/col_inner]\n[col_inner span=\"2\" span__sm=\"7\" span__md=\"3\" padding=\"30px 30px 30px 30px\" bg_color=\"rgb(255, 255, 255)\" border=\"0px 0px 0px 0px\"]\n\n[ux_image id=\"1616\" link=\"https://share.google/cJWr03bpmlOJfILIF\"]\n\n\n[/col_inner]\n\n[/row_inner]\n\n[/col]\n\n[/row]\n\n[/section]\n[section bg=\"563\" bg_size=\"original\" bg_overlay=\"rgba(238, 224, 224, 0.331)\" bg_pos=\"57% 0%\" border=\"0px 0px 0px 0px\" visibility=\"hidden\"]\n\n[row]\n\n[col span__sm=\"12\" margin=\"0px 0px -40px 0px\"]\n\n[row_inner]\n\n[col_inner span=\"7\" span__sm=\"12\" class=\"appointment\"]\n\n[gap height=\"90px\" visibility=\"hide-for-medium\"]\n\n[gap visibility=\"show-for-small\"]\n\n[ux_text text_align=\"center\" class=\"phongvt-title-main h2\"]\n\n<h2>Connect with Vionis Travel</h2>\n[/ux_text]\n[contact-form-7 id=\"87\"]\n\n\n[/col_inner]\n[col_inner span=\"5\" span__sm=\"12\" class=\"appointment\"]\n\n[ux_image id=\"912\" image_size=\"original\" class=\"phongvt-hieu-ung-toa-hinh\"]\n\n\n[/col_inner]\n\n[/row_inner]\n\n[/col]\n\n[/row]\n\n[/section]', 'Homepage', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '1138-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-07-14 14:37:17', '2026-07-14 07:37:17', '', 1138, 'https://vionistravel.com/?p=1830', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(1831, 7, '2026-07-14 14:39:06', '2026-07-14 07:39:06', '{\n    \"custom_css[flatsome-child]\": {\n        \"value\": \"/* Responsive cho laptop m\\u00e0n h\\u00ecnh nh\\u1ecf (1025px - 1399px) b\\u1eb1ng c\\u00e1ch c\\u1ed1 \\u0111\\u1ecbnh chi\\u1ec1u ngang container */\\n@media (min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 1399px) {\\n    .container, \\n    .container-width,\\n    .section-content,\\n    .section-inner {\\n        max-width: 1170px !important;\\n        margin-left: auto !important;\\n        margin-right: auto !important;\\n    }\\n}\\n\\n\\n\\n/* B\\u1ecf uppercase to\\u00e0n b\\u1ed9 menu dropdown */\\n.nav-dropdown a,\\n.nav-dropdown ul a,\\n.nav-dropdown li > a,\\n.nav-dropdown .nav-dropdown-col > a,\\n.nav-dropdown .sub-menu a,\\n.nav-dropdown .nav-column a{\\n    text-transform: none !important;\\n}\\n\\n/*css danh m\\u1ee5c tour*/\\n.vionis-tour-card h3 {\\n\\tfont-size: 30px !important;\\n}\\n\\n.vionis-tour-card h3 {\\n    line-height: 38px !important;\\n}\\n\\n/*css header*/\\n#header .header-nav-main>.menu-item>a{\\n\\tfont-size: 15px !important;\\n}\\n.header-nav-main>li {\\n    margin: 0 10px !important;\\n}\\n\\n.trust h2,\\n.trust h4{\\n\\tcolor: white;\\n}\\n\\n/*css contact form about*/\\n.page-id-59 #wpcf7-f87-p59-o1 .wpcf7-text,\\n.page-id-59 #wpcf7-f87-p59-o1 .wpcf7-email,\\n.page-id-59 #wpcf7-f87-p59-o1 .wpcf7-tel,\\n.page-id-59 #wpcf7-f87-p59-o1 .wpcf7-textarea {\\n    color: var(--primary-color);\\n}\\n\\n/*css menu header*/\\n.nav-left {\\n    justify-content: center;\\n}\\n/*css menu header*/\\n\\n/*css social footer*/\\n.footer-social{\\n    display:flex;\\n    gap:10px;\\n    align-items:center;\\n    flex-wrap:wrap;\\n}\\n\\n.footer-social a{\\n    width:40px;\\n    height:40px;\\n    border-radius:50%;\\n    background:#2b322d;\\n    color:#fff;\\n    display:flex;\\n    align-items:center;\\n    justify-content:center;\\n    text-decoration:none;\\n    transition:all .3s ease;\\n}\\n\\n.footer-social a:hover{\\n    background:#127faf;\\n    transform:translateY(-2px);\\n}\\n\\n.footer-social a i{\\n    font-size:18px;\\n    line-height:1;\\n}\\n\\n.footer-social a img{\\n    width:22px;\\n    height:22px;\\n    object-fit:contain;\\n    display:block;\\n}\\n/*css social footer*/\\n\\n.html_nav_position_text {\\n    margin-right: 0 !important;\\n}\\n\\n/*css 1/6/2026*/\\n.main-title * {\\n    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 5vw, 3rem); /* 28px -> 48px */\\n    font-weight: bold;\\n}\\n\\n.mobile {\\n    display: none;\\n}\\n\\n@media (max-width: 767px) {\\n    .mobile {\\n        display: block;\\n    }\\n}\\n\\n.gtranslate-custom {\\n    text-align: right;\\n}\\n\\n.lightbox-content {\\n    padding: 30px 30px 10px 30px !important;\\n}\\n\\n/*css 1/6/2026*/\\n\\n/* Giao di\\u1ec7n GTranslate */\\n.gtranslate-custom select {\\n    background-color: #ffffff;\\n    color: #222;\\n    border: 1px solid #ddd;\\n    border-radius: 8px;\\n    padding: 6px 10px;\\n    font-size: 15px;\\n    box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);\\n    cursor: pointer;\\n    transition: all 0.3s ease;\\n}\\n\\n/* Hover select */\\n.gtranslate-custom select:hover {\\n    border-color: #0073e6;\\n    background-color: #f0f8ff;\\n}\\n\\n/* Link ng\\u00f4n ng\\u1eef */\\n.gtranslate-custom a {\\n    display: inline-flex;\\n    align-items: center;\\n    text-decoration: none;\\n    padding: 6px 10px;\\n    margin: 5px 3px;\\n    background: #f9f9f9;\\n    color: #333;\\n    border: 1px solid #ddd;\\n    border-radius: 6px;\\n    font-size: 14px;\\n    transition: all 0.3s;\\n}\\n\\n/* Icon c\\u1edd qu\\u1ed1c gia trong link */\\n.gtranslate-custom a img {\\n    width: 20px;\\n    height: 14px;\\n    margin-right: 5px;\\n    object-fit: cover;\\n}\\n\\n/* Hover link */\\n.gtranslate-custom a:hover {\\n    background: #0073e6;\\n    color: #fff;\\n    border-color: #0073e6;\\n}\\n\\n/* Responsive Mobile */\\n@media (max-width: 768px) {\\n    .gtranslate-custom {\\n        display: flex;\\n        justify-content: center; /* C\\u0103n gi\\u1eefa */\\n        align-items: center;\\n        flex-wrap: nowrap; /* Kh\\u00f4ng cho xu\\u1ed1ng h\\u00e0ng */\\n        gap: 5px;\\n    }\\n    .gtranslate-custom a {\\n        flex: 0 0 auto;\\n        padding: 4px 8px;\\n        font-size: 13px;\\n    }\\n    .gtranslate-custom a img {\\n        width: 16px; /* Icon nh\\u1ecf h\\u01a1n */\\n        height: 12px;\\n        margin-right: 3px;\\n    }\\n}\\n\\n.has-hover .bg,\\n.has-hover [class*=image-] img {\\n    transition: filter 0.6s ease, opacity 0.6s ease, transform 0.6s ease, box-shadow 0.4s ease;\\n    transform-origin: center center;\\n}\\n\\n/* Khi hover */\\n.has-hover:hover .bg,\\n.has-hover:hover [class*=image-] img {\\n    transform: scale(1.03) rotateZ(0.3deg) translateY(-2px); /* chuy\\u1ec3n \\u0111\\u1ed9ng nh\\u1eb9 l\\u00ean */\\n    filter: brightness(1.2) contrast(1.1) saturate(1.2); /* gi\\u1ea3m \\u0111\\u1ed9 s\\u00e1ng v\\u00e0 b\\u00e3o h\\u00f2a */\\n    box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4), \\n                0 0 40px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3), \\n                0 0 60px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2), \\n                0 5px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1); /* b\\u00f3ng \\u0111\\u1ed5 m\\u1ec1m */\\n    opacity: 1;\\n}\\n\\n\\n\\n.box-text a:not(.button),\\n.box-text h4,\\n.box-text h5,\\n.box-text h6 {\\n    line-height: 1.3;\\n    color: rgb(211 27 27);\\n    margin-bottom: .1em;\\n    margin-top: .1em;\\n    transition: color 0.3s ease, transform 0.3s ease;\\n}\\n\\n.box-text a:not(.button):hover,\\n.box-text h4:hover,\\n.box-text h5:hover,\\n.box-text h6:hover {\\n    color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\\n    transform: translateY(-3px);\\n    cursor: pointer;\\n}\\n\\n\\n\\n.home_blog .box-blog-post:hover {\\n    box-shadow: 0 0px 22px #84c8ff;\\n    transform: scale(1.02);\\n    padding: 10px 20px;\\n    text-align: left;\\n}\\n.home_blog .box-blog-post {\\n    box-shadow: 0 0 18px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);\\n    border-radius: 10px; /* Bo g\\u00f3c */\\n    transition: all 0.s ease;\\n}\\n.home_blog .box-blog-post:hover {\\n    box-shadow: 0 0px 5px #84c8ff;\\n    transform: scale(1.02);\\n    padding: 10px 20px;\\n    text-align: left;\\n    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05); /* Gi\\u1eef vi\\u1ec1n khi hover */\\n}\\n\\n\\n.tour-outbound {\\n    padding: 4.18rem var(--section) 8.81rem;\\n    background: var(--Linear, linear-gradient(90deg, var(--Color, #023F88) 0%, var(--Color-2, #0071BB) 100%));\\n    display: flex\\n;\\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\\n    justify-content: space-between;\\n}\\n\\n.tour-outbound .tour-outbound__title h2 {\\n    color: #fff;\\n    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);\\n    font-style: normal;\\n    font-weight: 700;\\n    line-height: 1.2;\\n    text-transform: uppercase;\\n}\\n\\n.home-introduce .home-introduce__title h1 {\\n    margin-bottom: 1.06rem;\\n}\\n\\n.phongvt-title-main h2,\\n.phongvt-title-main h1,\\n.phongvt-title-main h3,\\n.phongvt-title-main-p p {\\n    object-position: 50% 50%;\\n    color: var(--Color, #06346c);\\n    font-size: 3.5rem;\\n    font-style: normal;\\n    font-weight: 700;\\n    line-height: normal;\\n    text-transform: uppercase;\\n}\\n\\n/* Tablet */\\n@media (max-width: 991px) {\\n    .phongvt-title-main h2,\\n    .phongvt-title-main h1,\\n    .phongvt-title-main h3,\\n    .phongvt-title-main-p p {\\n        font-size: 2.5rem;\\n    }\\n}\\n\\n/* Mobile */\\n@media (max-width: 767px) {\\n    .phongvt-title-main h2,\\n    .phongvt-title-main h1,\\n    .phongvt-title-main h3,\\n    .phongvt-title-main-p p {\\n        font-size: 1.8rem;\\n        line-height: 1.3;\\n    }\\n}\\n\\n\\n\\n.tour-outbound {\\n    padding: 4.18rem var(--section) 8.81rem;\\n    background: var(--Linear, linear-gradient(90deg, var(--Color, #023F88) 0%, var(--Color-2, #0071BB) 100%));\\n    display: flex\\n;\\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\\n    justify-content: space-between;\\n}\\n\\n.fix-section {\\n    border-radius: 2.75rem 2.75rem 0rem 0rem;\\n    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #01549D 0%, var(--Color-2, #0071BB) 60.5%);\\n    padding: 4.44rem var(--section) 16.45rem;\\n    overflow: hidden;\\n}\\n\\n\\n.appointment .item label {\\n    font-size: 14px;\\n    font-weight: 500;\\n    position: absolute;\\n    z-index: 1;\\n    background: #fff;\\n    left: 10px;\\n\\n    padding: 0 10px;\\n    display: inline-block;\\n    width: auto;\\n    border-radius: 8px;\\n    color: #333;\\n}\\n.appointment {\\n    background: #fff;\\n    position: relative;\\n    z-index: 1;\\n}\\n\\n\\n#header .header-nav-main>.menu-item>a {\\n    color: #404040;\\n    font-size: 1.1rem;\\n    font-style: normal;\\n\\ttransition: color 0.3s ease;\\n    font-weight: 600;\\n    line-height: 1.35rem;\\n    padding: var(--30) 0;\\n}\\n#header .header-nav-main > .menu-item.current-menu-item > a {\\n    color: #023f88; /* M\\u00e0u xanh d\\u01b0\\u01a1ng */\\n}\\n#header .header-nav-main > .menu-item > a:hover {\\n    color: #023f88; /* M\\u00e0u xanh d\\u01b0\\u01a1ng */\\n}\\n\\n\\n.phongvt-hieu-ung-toa-hinh {\\n    display: block;\\n    position: relative;\\n    overflow: hidden\\n}\\n\\n.phongvt-hieu-ung-toa-hinh:before {\\n    position: absolute;\\n    top: 50%;\\n    left: 50%;\\n    z-index: 2;\\n    display: block;\\n    content: \'\';\\n    width: 0;\\n    height: 0;\\n    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.2);\\n    border-radius: 100%;\\n    opacity: 0;\\n    -webkit-transform: translate(-50%, -50%);\\n    -ms-transform: translate(-50%, -50%);\\n    -o-transform: translate(-50%, -50%);\\n    transform: translate(-50%, -50%)\\n}\\n\\n@media (min-width: 1025px) {\\n    .phongvt-hieu-ung-toa-hinh:hover:before {\\n        -webkit-animation:circle 0.75s;\\n        -ms-animation: circle 0.75s;\\n        -o-animation: circle 0.75s;\\n        animation: circle 0.75s\\n    }\\n}\\n\\n@-ms-keyframes circle {\\n    0% {\\n        opacity: 1\\n    }\\n\\n    40% {\\n        opacity: 1\\n    }\\n\\n    100% {\\n        width: 200%;\\n        height: 200%;\\n        opacity: 0\\n    }\\n}\\n\\n@-o-keyframes circle {\\n    0% {\\n        opacity: 1\\n    }\\n\\n    40% {\\n        opacity: 1\\n    }\\n\\n    100% {\\n        width: 200%;\\n        height: 200%;\\n        opacity: 0\\n    }\\n}\\n\\n@-webkit-keyframes circle {\\n    0% {\\n        opacity: 1\\n    }\\n\\n    40% {\\n        opacity: 1\\n    }\\n\\n    100% {\\n        width: 200%;\\n        height: 200%;\\n        opacity: 0\\n    }\\n}\\n\\n@keyframes circle {\\n    0% {\\n        opacity: 1\\n    }\\n\\n    40% {\\n        opacity: 1\\n    }\\n\\n    100% {\\n        width: 200%;\\n        height: 200%;\\n        opacity: 0\\n    }\\n}\",\n        \"type\": \"custom_css\",\n        \"user_id\": 7,\n        \"date_modified_gmt\": \"2026-07-14 07:39:06\"\n    }\n}', '', '', 'trash', 'closed', 'closed', '', '1d038f52-bbaa-4bdb-ae52-d34ac30aee94', '', '', '2026-07-14 14:39:06', '2026-07-14 07:39:06', '', 0, 'https://vionistravel.com/1d038f52-bbaa-4bdb-ae52-d34ac30aee94/', 0, 'customize_changeset', '', 0);
